  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110208
    - rid: 6136300951190110209
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110213
    - rid: 6136300951190110215
    - rid: 6136300951190110216
    - rid: 6136300951190110217
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Odd, the door was unlocked, so this place should be open-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110218
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, customers?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110220
    - rid: 6136300951190110221
    - rid: 6136300951190110222
    - rid: 6136300951190110223
    - rid: 6136300951190110224
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm sorry, I've just been a bit... shaken up after-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, it's a private matter, you don't need to be worried about it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110227
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you all here for food and drink, or room and board?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110228
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: We're here for dinner! Mind if we take a seat?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110225
    - rid: 6136300951190110229
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: That's- that's fine. Go ahead and sit at one of the tables.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110226
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: I do ask that you keep your dog under control; don't let it get onto
      the tables.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: (I'll never deal with <i>that</i> again...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori makes her way to one of the tables, leading Meeko to go along
      with her.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110230
    - rid: 6136300951190110232
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: Will I be starting you with drinks?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110233
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, two Honningbrew meads and- you got milk?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110234
    - rid: 6136300951190110236
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807305c1443a2d645ab64d7fc7cb5526, type: 2}
    dialog: Milk? Yes, I do. Two Honningbrews and a cup of milk, then?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110235
    - rid: 6136300951190110237
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That's right, thanks.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110238
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Having placed their drink order, {mc} and Yuri turn to make their way
      to Sayori and Meeko.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110239
    - rid: 6136300951190110240
    - rid: 6136300951190110241
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>{mc}, didn't Sayori like the Honningbrew mead too?</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110242
    - rid: 6136300951190110243
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The milk's not for <i>her</i>, Yuri.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110244
    - rid: 6136300951190110245
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>Oh? I didn't know you drank milk, {mc}.</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110246
    - rid: 6136300951190110247
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The milk's for <i>you</i>, Yuri.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110248
    - rid: 6136300951190110249
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>H-huh? But I wanted more Honningbrew- I'd even take some
      wine...</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110250
    - rid: 6136300951190110251
    - rid: 6136300951190110252
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri, no. We've already had one intervention with you, we're not having
      another.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110253
    - rid: 6136300951190110254
    - rid: 6136300951190110255
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>But I'm not an alcoholic-</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110256
    - rid: 6136300951190110257
    - rid: 6136300951190110258
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri... Natsuki, {mc}, and I; we all think that you've had too much to
      drink today.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110259
    - rid: 6136300951190110260
    - rid: 6136300951190110261
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: No one's saying you're an alcoholic.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110262
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Yet.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110263
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: We just want to make sure you're living well-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110264
    - rid: 6136300951190110265
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: And, uh, you are obviously... <i>under the influence</i> right now.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110266
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>...</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110267
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>... hm.</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110268
    - rid: 6136300951190110269
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>I disagree, but I don't want to worry any of you.</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110270
    - rid: 6136300951190110271
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Thank you, Yuri.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110272
    - rid: 6136300951190110273
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The trio have gotten their respective drinks, ordering their dinner in
      the process.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110274
    - rid: 6136300951190110275
    - rid: 6136300951190110276
    - rid: 6136300951190110277
    - rid: 6136300951190110278
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori ordered some venison handpies...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110279
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} ordered a piece of goatherd''s pie...'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110280
    - rid: 6136300951190110281
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: And Yuri ordered a bowl of apple cabbage stew.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110282
    - rid: 6136300951190110283
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>So, Sayori, you were jailed by the Thalmor?</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110284
    - rid: 6136300951190110285
    - rid: 6136300951190110286
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, yeah, why do you ask?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110287
    - rid: 6136300951190110288
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>Well, I think it's a bit of coincidence:</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110289
    - rid: 6136300951190110290
    - rid: 6136300951190110291
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>Mirabelle actually had me help her with what could be considered
      as a Thalmor audit for the whole Ancano situation.</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110292
    - rid: 6136300951190110293
    - rid: 6136300951190110294
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Somebody better call Wendy's, because just like that we're <NoiseText=1,10>four
      for four</NoiseText>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110295
    - rid: 6136300951190110296
    - rid: 6136300951190110297
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>What did you mean by that, {mc}?</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110298
    - rid: 6136300951190110299
    - rid: 6136300951190110300
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: And who's Wendy?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110301
    - rid: 6136300951190110302
    - rid: 6136300951190110303
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Nothing, it's just now that I have confirmation that all four of you
      have had some run in with the Thalmor.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110304
    - rid: 6136300951190110305
    - rid: 6136300951190110306
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>Hm, since all of us have been spread around the province...</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110307
    - rid: 6136300951190110308
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>It is a bit concerning that we've all run into altercations
      with Thalmor independently of each other.</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110309
    - rid: 6136300951190110310
    - rid: 6136300951190110311
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That's what I'm sayin'!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110312
    - rid: 6136300951190110313
    - rid: 6136300951190110314
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: This all but confirms my idea that the entity is making the Thalmor more
      active than they were originally.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110315
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>As a means of providing conflict for their story?</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110316
    - rid: 6136300951190110317
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Probably.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110318
    - rid: 6136300951190110319
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: B-but, {mc}!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110320
    - rid: 6136300951190110321
    - rid: 6136300951190110322
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: What?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110323
    - rid: 6136300951190110324
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You never told us who Wendy was!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110325
    - rid: 6136300951190110326
    - rid: 6136300951190110327
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... you remember how I said I was American?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110328
    - rid: 6136300951190110329
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110330
    - rid: 6136300951190110331
    - rid: 6136300951190110332
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=0.5>Wait, you're American-?</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110333
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So there's this prominent fast-food burger joint...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110335
    - rid: 6136300951190110336
    - rid: 6136300951190110337
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110338
    - rid: 6136300951190110339
    - rid: 6136300951190110340
    - rid: 6136300951190110341
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: While {mc} was explaining the fast-food franchise, its menu items and
      general cultural relevance, Elrindir served everyone their meals.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110342
    - rid: 6136300951190110343
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: So, is the food there actually any good?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110344
    - rid: 6136300951190110345
    - rid: 6136300951190110346
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori, in-case you forgot, we've only been alive for two weeks.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110347
    - rid: 6136300951190110348
    - rid: 6136300951190110349
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The only possible conception I could have of it is pre-written false
      memories.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110350
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: No, I didn't forget that, it's just-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110352
    - rid: 6136300951190110353
    - rid: 6136300951190110354
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri, you know how you said that true writing comes from the heart?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110355
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course, I still think it holds true even in the face of our digital
      existence, why?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110356
    - rid: 6136300951190110357
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, whoever wrote our backstories, whether it be that entity guy or
      someone else...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110358
    - rid: 6136300951190110359
    - rid: 6136300951190110360
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: They were probably writing based off of something they personally knew,
      or what someone they knew... knew.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110361
    - rid: 6136300951190110362
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: So, I think our backstories aren't completely...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: -2
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh... what's the word for random or out of nowhere?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110363
    - rid: 6136300951190110364
    - rid: 6136300951190110365
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm. Arbitrary?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110366
    - rid: 6136300951190110367
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, arbitrary! I think our backstories aren't completely arbitrary.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110368
    - rid: 6136300951190110369
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: So, what do your memories say about eating at Wendy's?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110370
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We probably won't ever be able to eat at a real Wendy's-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110372
    - rid: 6136300951190110373
    - rid: 6136300951190110374
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: That wasn't my question, I asked what you remember!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110376
    - rid: 6136300951190110377
    - rid: 6136300951190110378
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110379
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The burgers were alright, if a bit too saucy.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110380
    - rid: 6136300951190110381
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: As in needlessly lathered in condiments?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110383
    - rid: 6136300951190110384
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, that.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300951190110385
    - rid: 6136300951190110386
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: What would it even matter to you, anyway?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863040
    - rid: 6136300972155863041
    - rid: 6136300972155863042
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '''Cause I want to know more about the real world.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863043
    - rid: 6136300972155863044
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: It's gotta be bigger than just what our little game corner was trying
      to mimic, right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863045
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Besides, it's nice to know more about where you're supposed to be from.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863046
    - rid: 6136300972155863047
    - rid: 6136300972155863048
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I hadn't really thought of that.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863049
    - rid: 6136300972155863050
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I've been pretty fascinated with the histories and cosmology of the world
      we've found ourselves in-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: But it <i>is</i> true that we don't know that much about the real world.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863051
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Even if the world-building of our home was intended to be accurate to
      the author's understanding of their world-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863054
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I consider it probable that the real world would still have interesting
      differences compared to our own.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863053
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863055
    - rid: 6136300972155863056
    - rid: 6136300972155863057
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm sorry {mc}, I can tell you don't really like thinking about how none
      of this is real.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863058
    - rid: 6136300972155863059
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: 'But, hey, think of it this way:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863060
    - rid: 6136300972155863061
    - rid: 6136300972155863062
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: If we make it out of here, we'll have a full world at our fingertips!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863063
    - rid: 6136300972155863064
    - rid: 6136300972155863068
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If we make it out...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863065
    - rid: 6136300972155863066
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori, I'm willing to entertain the slimmest possibility of us somehow
      finding a way back into our original game.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863067
    - rid: 6136300972155863070
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But making it to the real world?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863071
    - rid: 6136300972155863072
    - rid: 6136300972155863073
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't even know where to begin to explain how impossible that is.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863074
    - rid: 6136300972155863075
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: U-um...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863076
    - rid: 6136300972155863077
    - rid: 6136300972155863089
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe {Player} would know of a way to go to the real world...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863078
    - rid: 6136300972155863079
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863080
    - rid: 6136300972155863081
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863091
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: But you see? There really is a chance!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863082
    - rid: 6136300972155863083
    - rid: 6136300972155863084
    - rid: 6136300972155863090
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: It might take us a while...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863085
    - rid: 6136300972155863086
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: But we don't need to stay fake!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300972155863087
    - rid: 6136300972155863088
